      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The hateful dating request is mapped onto Adolf Hitler",
      "description": "The bottom text 'i just want a girl who laugh at my racist jokes and cuddle me is it to much to ask!' is explicitly attributed to the speaker (the person making the request), who is visually represented by Adolf Hitler. The meme uses Hitler's image to symbolize the speaker's persona, creating an analogical mapping where the hateful dating request is projected onto Hitler as the visual embodiment of the speaker. This is a direct and provocative mapping that equates the speaker's romantic ideal with the historical figure associated with genocide and racism.",
